        ("BEFORE // RAW UNSTRUCTURED STATE DOT SPECIAL PROVISION PDF", "BEFORE // RAW PAYER CLINICAL POLICY BULLETIN &amp; 835 ERA DENIAL TEXT"),
        ("SPECIAL PROVISION TO ITEM 3076 (DENSE-GRADED HOT-MIX ASPHALT)\nContractor shall place 48,500 TON PG 76-22 SAC-A surface course during nighttime lane closure window 21:00 to 05:00 only. Liquidated damages: $3,850/day. Lane rental overrun penalty: $2,000/hour. DBE Goal: 10.5%. Wage Decision: TX20260038.", "PAYER CLINICAL POLICY BULLETIN CPB-0592 &amp; 835 ERA REMITTANCE (CARC CO-45 / CO-50)\nClaim CPT 29881 (Knee Arthroscopy Meniscectomy) &amp; CPT 27447 (Total Knee Arthroplasty) adjusted under CARC CO-45 to QPA $920.00. Payer asserts 6-week physical therapy prerequisite and NCCI Column 2 bundling on ipsilateral compartment."),
        ("AFTER // RUBRICWARD AI BID-TAB, WH-347 WAGE &amp; BABA OUTPUT", "AFTER // RUBRICWARD AI PAYER MRF, MEDICARE MPFS &amp; ERISA/IDR OUTPUT"),
        ("1. PAY-ITEM 36-MO BID-TAB MODEL (API #02):\n   - Item 3076-6001 (48,500 TON): 36-Mo Low Avg $108.50/Ton -> Recommended Bid $112.90/Ton ($5,475,650.00)\n   - Item 0420-6013 Structural Concrete (4,200 CY): Recommended Bid $925.00/CY ($3,885,000.00)\n2. LIQUIDATED DAMAGES &amp; LANE RENTAL (API #01):\n   - $3,850/calendar day + $2,000/hr night lane overrun risk flagged\n3. DAVIS-BACON WH-347 &amp; BABA STEEL (API #03/#05):\n   - Paving Operator Loaded Rate: $55.25/hr • 100% U.S. Melt &amp; Pour Rebar Required", "1. COMMERCIAL PAYER TIC MRF BENCHMARK (API #02):\n   - CPT 29881 (420 Claims): MRF 25th $640.00 | Median QPA $1,485.00 | 75th-Pct Target $1,890.00 ($793,800.00)\n   - CPT 27447 (115 Claims): MRF Median QPA $9,420.00 | 75th-Pct Target $11,850.00 ($1,362,750.00)\n2. MEDICARE MPFS RVU/GPCI &amp; NCCI AUDIT (API #03/#05):\n   - DFW Locality 04412-11 MPFS Baseline Verified • Modifier 59/XS Distinct Compartment Supported\n3. ERISA 29 CFR 2560.503-1 &amp; PROMPT-PAY (API #06/#09):\n   - TX Ins. Code § 1301.103 (18% APR Penalty) + NSA 45 CFR 149.510 IDR Brief Ready"),
