        ("SECTION 00 73 00 — SUPPLEMENTARY CONDITIONS\n- Liquidated Damages: $3,500 / calendar day beyond substantial completion\n- Nighttime Lane Closure Window: 21:00 to 05:00 local ($1,500/hr overrun penalty)\n\nCSI SUBMITTAL REGISTER (EXTRACTED):\n- Div 03 30 00 Cast-in-Place Concrete: Mix Design &amp; 28-Day Cylinder Break Certs\n- Div 31 23 00 Excavation &amp; Fill: Proctor Compaction &amp; Dewatering Plan\n- Div 32 12 16 Asphalt Paving: Superpave PG 76-22 JMF &amp; Tack Coat Submittal\n- Div 34 41 13 Traffic Signals &amp; ITS: NEMA TS2 Controller &amp; Fiber OTDR Test", "PAYER CLINICAL POLICY BULLETIN (CPB) &amp; CMS LCD/NCD SHRED\n- Timely Filing &amp; ERISA Appeal Window: 180 Calendar Days from EOB/835 ERA under 29 CFR 2560.503-1\n- State Statutory Prompt-Pay Interest: 18% APR Penalty (TX Ins. Code § 1301.103)\n\nREQUIRED CLINICAL &amp; PRIOR-AUTH DOCUMENTATION (EXTRACTED):\n- CPT 29881 / 27447: Weight-Bearing Radiograph / MRI Report + 6-Week Conservative Therapy Notes\n- CMS NCCI PTP Override: Operative Note Documenting Distinct Compartment (Modifier 59 / XS)\n- CPT 99214-25: Separately Identifiable E/M HPI &amp; MDM Documentation\n- Federal NSA IDR Window: 30-Business-Day Open Negotiation -> 4-Business-Day IDR Initiation"),
